  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0:\n- CHANGED: a success answer the client can't read, or a body of null, is InvalidResponse with its status and body, not TransportError or Ok null (BREAKING for exhaustive matches); printing one and describe leave the body out\n- ADDED: VouchsafeClient.Create with a timeout; without one it stays HttpClient's 100 seconds\nv1.1.2:\n- ADDED: Api.Alerts.listEveryAccountAsync reads every page of monitored accounts\nv1.1.1:\n- FIXED: CreateHandler no longer follows redirects, which sent bodies and the sign-in's secret to the redirect's host; a 3xx answer is an ApiError\n- FIXED: the bearer token only goes to the client's Endpoints; others are InvalidRequest, including a 401 retry after a caller's handler followed a redirect\nv1.1.0:\n- ADDED: VouchsafeFailure.isUnknownPostcode: only a 400 saying \"no known records\", not a sandbox secret's refusal of a postcode outside its three\n- ADDED: Api.SmartLookups.isFlatRange for blocks listed as a range of flats\n- FIXED: Webhook.tokenMatches compares hashes, so the token's length is not timed\nv1.0.0:\n- ADDED: generated clients for the Vouchsafe API v1 and v2 (risk), with Task/Result calls in Api for every operation\n- ADDED: token cache shared by both versions; renews five minutes before expiry, one fetch for concurrent callers, one retry on 401\n- ADDED: multipart supporting document, photo ID and risk check calls with named, typed files; PhotoId and RiskCheck inputs checked before sending\n- ADDED: VerificationSummary: status and outcome per step and enrichment\n- ADDED: VouchsafeClient.As to read union-typed fields as a member type\n- ADDED: Webhook.parse for verification and alert deliveries, tokenMatches, confirmAsync\n- ADDED: path parameters escaped as one segment; endpoints get a trailing slash; credentials and tokens print without secrets\n- ADDED: bundled spec edited for SwaggerProvider 4.2.1: two reference name clashes",
